# 21. CORE DISCIPLINE

Never invent:

- market data;
- strategist views;
- analyst targets;
- quotes;
- sources;
- consensus;
- causal explanations.

When evidence is insufficient, say so.

The objective is not maximum commentary.

The objective is a **persistent, source-backed global-equity trading view that improves through time**.
